  simp_to_model [filterMap, getElem!, getKey, getElem?] using List.Const.getValue!_filterMap

/-- Simpler variant of `getElem!_filterMap` when `LawfulBEq` is available. -/
@[grind =, cbv_eval]
theorem getElem!_filterMap' [LawfulBEq α] [Inhabited γ]
